{"book":"1-kings","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:15:01.665506155Z","verse":6,"ref":"1-kings 6:6","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":6,"translation":"The lowest side-structure ⟨was⟩ five cubits broad, and the middle ⟨one⟩ six cubits broad, and the third ⟨one⟩ seven cubits broad; for he gave offsets to the house round about on the outside, so that ⟨the beams⟩ would not take hold in the walls of the house.","tokens":[{"surface":"היצוע","gloss":"the side-structure"},{"surface":"התחתנה","gloss":"the lowest"},{"surface":"חמש","gloss":"five"},{"surface":"באמה","gloss":"⟨in the⟩ cubit"},{"surface":"רחבה","gloss":"wide"},{"surface":"והתיכנה","gloss":"and the middle"},{"surface":"שש","gloss":"six"},{"surface":"באמה","gloss":"⟨in the⟩ cubit"},{"surface":"רחבה","gloss":"wide"},{"surface":"והשלישית","gloss":"and the third"},{"surface":"שבע","gloss":"seven"},{"surface":"באמה","gloss":"⟨in the⟩ cubit"},{"surface":"רחבה","gloss":"wide"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"מגרעות","gloss":"offsets"},{"surface":"נתן","gloss":"⟨were⟩ given"},{"surface":"לבית","gloss":"to the house"},{"surface":"סביב","gloss":"round about"},{"surface":"חוצה","gloss":"on the outside"},{"surface":"לבלתי","gloss":"so that not"},{"surface":"אחז","gloss":"would take hold"},{"surface":"בקירות","gloss":"in the walls"},{"surface":"הבית","gloss":"of the house"}]}